  "glossary": {
    "occupation": "işgal",
    "insurgency": "silahlı isyan",
    "resistance": "direniş",
    "enslave": "köleleştirmek",
    "surveillance": "gözetim",
    "weapon": "silah",
    "humanity": "insanlık"
  },
  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 15.481,
      "end": 19.452,
      "text": "[♪♪♪]"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.258,
      "end": 28.461,
      "text": "We were once mankind."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.763,
      "end": 32.298,
      "text": "We were humanity."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.071,
      "end": 41.807,
      "text": "And now..."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.807,
      "end": 43.576,
      "text": "We're no more than pests."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.544,
      "end": 47.847,
      "text": "Vermin."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.847,
      "end": 50.05,
      "text": "They came here to exterminate us."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.888,
      "end": 57.357,
      "text": "They took our history and culture."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.357,
      "end": 61.561,
      "text": "They covered our landworks in dying humanity."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.561,
      "end": 64.097,
      "text": "The wail of the dying carried for miles."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.733,
      "end": 68.701,
      "text": "They're building some kind of breeding facility"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.701,
      "end": 71.404,
      "text": "for those that survive."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.404,
      "end": 74.607,
      "text": "People that have defected say it's worse than Hell,"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.607,
      "end": 77.31,
      "text": "humans becoming some kind of surrogate incubators"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.31,
      "end": 79.379,
      "text": "for the alien young."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.452,
      "end": 88.221,
      "text": "They killed us in waves when they first arrived."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.823,
      "end": 95.027,
      "text": "They built these megastructures that spew methane,"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.027,
      "end": 97.697,
      "text": "manufacturing their atmosphere."
    },
    {
      "start": 101,
      "end": 102.301,
      "text": "They've sown their crops,"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.301,
      "end": 103.936,
      "text": "snuffing out our plant life,"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.936,
      "end": 106.473,
      "text": "raising the global temperature, causing our cities to flood."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.808,
      "end": 111.878,
      "text": "They waged war on Earth."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.878,
      "end": 115.047,
      "text": "They set fire to our forests."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.047,
      "end": 117.617,
      "text": "It's already hard to breathe..."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.617,
      "end": 120.687,
      "text": "impossible to breathe if you are close to the stacks."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.422,
      "end": 125.524,
      "text": "Rats..."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.524,
      "end": 127.76,
      "text": "insects..."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.76,
      "end": 131.297,
      "text": "humans..."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.297,
      "end": 133.232,
      "text": "they hack into our psyche,"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.232,
      "end": 134.667,
      "text": "into our minds,"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.667,
      "end": 136.535,
      "text": "paralyzing us,"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.535,
      "end": 141.307,
      "text": "taking control of the cerebrum and the limbic system,"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.307,
      "end": 144.377,
      "text": "rendering us slaves."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.377,
      "end": 147.213,
      "text": "We've been able to design a brain barrier"
    },
    {
      "start": 147.213,
      "end": 150.416,
      "text": "that protects us from their influence."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.416,
      "end": 154.22,
      "text": "They know we can't produce enough of these for everyone,"
    },
    {
      "start": 154.22,
      "end": 155.722,
      "text": "that it's just a matter of time"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.722,
      "end": 159.925,
      "text": "before the entire planet is theirs..."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.925,
      "end": 161.494,
      "text": "but we're survivors."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.298,
      "end": 167.734,
      "text": "Scrounging enough to eat..."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.602,
      "end": 172.872,
      "text": "gathering enough morale to fight."
    },
    {
      "start": 180.913,
      "end": 182.448,
      "text": "[distorted voices over radio]"
    },
    {
      "start": 188.821,
      "end": 190.422,
      "text": "I wonder if deep down,"
    },
    {
      "start": 190.422,
      "end": 193.993,
      "text": "each person knows we're already dead."
    },
    {
      "start": 193.993,
      "end": 196.762,
      "text": "I wonder if only one, sick, primordial instinct"
    },
    {
      "start": 196.762,
      "end": 200.166,
      "text": "keeps marching us forward aimlessly."
    },
    {
      "start": 200.166,
      "end": 202.635,
      "text": "Every rational thought tells us it's over."
    },
    {
      "start": 206.706,
      "end": 209.409,
      "text": "Every vile, deceptive, chemical emotion"
    },
    {
      "start": 209.409,
      "end": 211.477,
      "text": "tells us it isn't."
    },
    {
      "start": 217.083,
      "end": 220.853,
      "text": "We are sold a different story by our politicians."
    },
    {
      "start": 254.354,
      "end": 256.255,
      "text": "Come with us!"
    },
    {
      "start": 256.255,
      "end": 259.558,
      "text": "Do not be afraid!"
    },
    {
      "start": 259.558,
      "end": 260.893,
      "text": "They want what's best for us!"
    },
    {
      "start": 260.893,
      "end": 262.562,
      "text": "Come on."
    },
    {
      "start": 264.73,
      "end": 269.935,
      "text": "They have built a conservatory for us!"
    },
    {
      "start": 269.935,
      "end": 272.872,
      "text": "Paradise!"
    },
    {
      "start": 272.872,
      "end": 274.974,
      "text": "Put down your guns!"
    },
    {
      "start": 274.974,
      "end": 276.742,
      "text": "There it is."
    },
    {
      "start": 276.742,
      "end": 281.113,
      "text": "Come on, freaky-faced fuck. Come on."
    },
    {
      "start": 281.113,
      "end": 282.715,
      "text": "Come with us!"
    },
    {
      "start": 282.715,
      "end": 285.584,
      "text": "Do not be afraid!"
    },
    {
      "start": 285.584,
      "end": 291.457,
      "text": "They have built a conservatory!"
    },
    {
      "start": 291.457,
      "end": 293.86,
      "text": "Come with us, friends!"
    },
    {
      "start": 293.86,
      "end": 295.294,
      "text": "Come on, come on, come on."
    },
    {
      "start": 295.294,
      "end": 297.196,
      "text": "...paradise!"
    },
    {
      "start": 297.196,
      "end": 299.598,
      "text": "I'll go to the new conservatory."
    },
    {
      "start": 299.598,
      "end": 303.068,
      "text": "Take me with you, please."
    },
    {
      "start": 303.068,
      "end": 304.57,
      "text": "There it is. There it is."
    },
    {
      "start": 314.613,
      "end": 315.682,
      "text": "[gasping]"
    },
    {
      "start": 317.149,
      "end": 318.283,
      "text": "[click]"
    },
    {
      "start": 318.283,
      "end": 319.619,
      "text": "[laughing]"
    },
    {
      "start": 333.966,
      "end": 337.603,
      "text": "Every once in a while, something goes our way."
    },
    {
      "start": 337.603,
      "end": 340.072,
      "text": "Just one in a thousand."
    },
    {
      "start": 340.072,
      "end": 341.741,
      "text": "Just enough to keep fighting."
    },
    {
      "start": 341.741,
      "end": 343.276,
      "text": "[cheering]"
    },
    {
      "start": 343.276,
      "end": 345.545,
      "text": "A glimmer of hope."
    },
    {
      "start": 348.981,
      "end": 350.95,
      "text": "People will pay for this."
    },
    {
      "start": 353.452,
      "end": 355.054,
      "text": "They always do."
    },
    {
      "start": 363.729,
      "end": 365.064,
      "text": "Even for small victories,"
    },
    {
      "start": 365.064,
      "end": 369.235,
      "text": "it would seem that everything was lost."
    },
    {
      "start": 369.235,
      "end": 373.005,
      "text": "Humanity would soon cease to exist."
    },
    {
      "start": 376.809,
      "end": 378.644,
      "text": "[groaning]"
    },
    {
      "start": 389.321,
      "end": 392.125,
      "text": "[gasping]"
    },
    {
      "start": 395.928,
      "end": 399.131,
      "text": "Until they arrived,"
    },
    {
      "start": 399.131,
      "end": 403.87,
      "text": "like angels carried on the rays of the Aurora Borealis."
    },
    {
      "start": 414.58,
      "end": 417.116,
      "text": "Like a biblical salvation."
    },
    {
      "start": 436.502,
      "end": 439.371,
      "text": "The new world altered everyone."
    },
    {
      "start": 439.371,
      "end": 442.108,
      "text": "Adapt or die, it was as simple as that."
    },
    {
      "start": 445.944,
      "end": 448.781,
      "text": "In the old world, Nosh would have been locked up."
    },
    {
      "start": 448.781,
      "end": 452.451,
      "text": "A pyromaniac, a bomb-maker..."
    },
    {
      "start": 452.451,
      "end": 456.121,
      "text": "but here, he not only survived, he thrived."
    },
    {
      "start": 456.121,
      "end": 457.824,
      "text": "[flying overhead]"
    },
    {
      "start": 465.197,
      "end": 467.7,
      "text": "[death metal blasts]"
    },
    {
      "start": 481.414,
      "end": 485.251,
      "text": "Nosh could make just about anything out of scavenged junk."
    },
    {
      "start": 488.42,
      "end": 493.225,
      "text": "Bombs, brain locks... anything."
    },
    {
      "start": 493.225,
      "end": 494.894,
      "text": "We needed him, and he knew it."
    },
    {
      "start": 494.894,
      "end": 497.462,
      "text": "How many you got?"
    },
    {
      "start": 497.462,
      "end": 499.732,
      "text": "Uh, four."
    },
    {
      "start": 499.732,
      "end": 501.166,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "start": 501.166,
      "end": 502.568,
      "text": "We need more than that."
    },
    {
      "start": 502.568,
      "end": 503.936,
      "text": "Sure, yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 503.936,
      "end": 505.137,
      "text": "And payment?"
    },
    {
      "start": 505.137,
      "end": 506.972,
      "text": "You can do the usual?"
    },
    {
      "start": 506.972,
      "end": 508.04,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, sure."
    },
    {
      "start": 508.04,
      "end": 509.908,
      "text": "What about the..."
    },
    {
      "start": 509.908,
      "end": 511.143,
      "text": "the item?"
    },
    {
      "start": 511.143,
      "end": 513.012,
      "text": "We've heard about it."
    },
    {
      "start": 515.447,
      "end": 516.983,
      "text": "Yeah, um..."
    },
    {
      "start": 518.383,
      "end": 519.318,
      "text": "It's not for sale."
    },
    {
      "start": 519.318,
      "end": 521.153,
      "text": "You piece of shit."
    },
    {
      "start": 521.153,
      "end": 522.721,
      "text": "[laughing]"
    },
    {
      "start": 522.721,
      "end": 523.822,
      "text": "You don't fuckin'..."
    },
    {
      "start": 523.822,
      "end": 524.556,
      "text": "Wait."
    },
    {
      "start": 524.556,
      "end": 526.559,
      "text": "My friend..."
    },
    {
      "start": 526.559,
      "end": 528.794,
      "text": "we need your help. You know that."
    },
    {
      "start": 528.794,
      "end": 529.762,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 529.762,
      "end": 530.997,
      "text": "Everything has a price,"
    },
    {
      "start": 530.997,
      "end": 532.331,
      "text": "and we can pay you."
    },
    {
      "start": 532.331,
      "end": 533.199,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "start": 533.199,
      "end": 535.1,
      "text": "Hmm."
    },
    {
      "start": 535.1,
      "end": 536.969,
      "text": "Hey, Jasper."
    },
    {
      "start": 536.969,
      "end": 539.004,
      "text": "I'm glad these fucking things came here."
    },
    {
      "start": 539.004,
      "end": 541.44,
      "text": "They mean that I get to burn whatever I see."
    },
    {
      "start": 541.44,
      "end": 542.574,
      "text": "Every day."
    },
    {
      "start": 542.574,
      "end": 543.475,
      "text": "Every night."
    },
    {
      "start": 543.475,
      "end": 544.376,
      "text": "No laws."
    },
    {
      "start": 544.376,
      "end": 546.278,
      "text": "No fucking jails."
    },
    {
      "start": 546.278,
      "end": 548.08,
      "text": "The fire..."
    },
    {
      "start": 548.08,
      "end": 549.014,
      "text": "The fire."
    },
    {
      "start": 549.014,
      "end": 551.483,
      "text": "What is it with you and the fucking fire?"
    },
    {
      "start": 551.483,
      "end": 552.852,
      "text": "Fire!!!"
    },
    {
      "start": 555.621,
      "end": 558.29,
      "text": "I'll die and perish in the fire someday."
    },
    {
      "start": 558.29,
      "end": 559.124,
      "text": "You say you need my help?"
    },
    {
      "start": 559.124,
      "end": 560.359,
      "text": "For what?"
    },
    {
      "start": 560.359,
      "end": 563.128,
      "text": "For a fucking hope for things to go back to the way they were?"
    },
    {
      "start": 563.128,
      "end": 564.597,
      "text": "[laughing]"
    },
    {
      "start": 564.597,
      "end": 566.432,
      "text": "Just give me... gimme some bait."
    },
    {
      "start": 566.432,
      "end": 567.566,
      "text": "Some bait?"
    },
    {
      "start": 567.566,
      "end": 568.4,
      "text": "I just need some bait,"
    },
    {
      "start": 568.4,
      "end": 569.368,
      "text": "some of your people..."
    },
    {
      "start": 569.368,
      "end": 570.569,
      "text": "some of your people,"
    },
    {
      "start": 570.569,
      "end": 572.004,
      "text": "some of the sick you don't need."
    },
    {
      "start": 573.138,
      "end": 574.006,
      "text": "I'm two seconds away"
    },
    {
      "start": 574.006,
      "end": 576.041,
      "text": "from blowing this motherfucker's head off."
    },
    {
      "start": 576.041,
      "end": 578.511,
      "text": "Oh, it would be so good. So much fun."
    },
    {
      "start": 578.511,
      "end": 580.246,
      "text": "Just a little more!"
    },
    {
      "start": 580.246,
      "end": 581.113,
      "text": "Gimme some bait."
    },
    {
      "start": 581.113,
      "end": 582.314,
      "text": "Gimme some bait."
    },
    {
      "start": 582.314,
      "end": 583.883,
      "text": "It'll make the \"boom\" bigger."
    },
    {
      "start": 583.883,
      "end": 585.15,
      "text": "I'll take out an entire convoy."
    },
    {
      "start": 585.15,
      "end": 587.186,
      "text": "That'll help you, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 587.186,
      "end": 589.956,
      "text": "I have enough ordnance to make this fire breathe."
    },
    {
      "start": 590.956,
      "end": 593.893,
      "text": "You're an interesting person, Nosh."
    },
    {
      "start": 595.127,
      "end": 596.929,
      "text": "Have fun in the fire."
    },
    {
      "start": 596.929,
      "end": 599.365,
      "text": "Oh, I will."
    },
    {
      "start": 599.365,
      "end": 600.599,
      "text": "[laughing]"
    },
    {
      "start": 600.599,
      "end": 605.07,
      "text": "Some sick people in exchange for Nosh's item."
    },
    {
      "start": 605.07,
      "end": 608.373,
      "text": "In peacetime, such an offer would be insane."
    },
    {
      "start": 608.373,
      "end": 609.708,
      "text": "Immoral."
    },
    {
      "start": 609.708,
      "end": 613.846,
      "text": "But now... anything's possible."
    },
    {
      "start": 615.08,
      "end": 616.748,
      "text": "[Carl]: Ma'am, we've done everything we can."
    },
    {
      "start": 616.748,
      "end": 618.217,
      "text": "He's not responding."
    },
    {
      "start": 623.255,
      "end": 624.991,
      "text": "All right. Let's go."
    },
    {
      "start": 628.961,
      "end": 632.231,
      "text": "We picked up Amir in Sector 7."
    },
    {
      "start": 632.231,
      "end": 634.7,
      "text": "At first, they thought he was dead,"
    },
    {
      "start": 634.7,
      "end": 637.303,
      "text": "some refuse from one of their experiments."
    },
    {
      "start": 641.406,
      "end": 642.975,
      "text": "Amir?"
    },
    {
      "start": 644.91,
      "end": 646.212,
      "text": "Amir?"
    },
    {
      "start": 650.349,
      "end": 652.985,
      "text": "Amir... Hey."
    },
    {
      "start": 654.653,
      "end": 656.188,
      "text": "I'm not going to hurt you."
    },
    {
      "start": 659.691,
      "end": 660.76,
      "text": "Look at me."
    },
    {
      "start": 660.76,
      "end": 663.361,
      "text": "You can help us."
    },
    {
      "start": 663.361,
      "end": 664.363,
      "text": "[Carl]: Kill him."
    },
    {
      "start": 664.363,
      "end": 666.097,
      "text": "Just fucking kill him."
    },
    {
      "start": 666.097,
      "end": 667.733,
      "text": "All that shit they put in his head."
    },
    {
      "start": 667.733,
      "end": 669.101,
      "text": "-He's not even one of us-- -Stop."
    },
    {
      "start": 676.275,
      "end": 678.71,
      "text": "I'm not going to hurt you."
    },
    {
      "start": 678.71,
      "end": 679.912,
      "text": "I know what they did."
    },
    {
      "start": 686.118,
      "end": 687.485,
      "text": "[he startles]"
    },
    {
      "start": 687.485,
      "end": 689.821,
      "text": "It's okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 689.821,
      "end": 691.39,
      "text": "Let's get this off."
    },
    {
      "start": 699.097,
      "end": 701.166,
      "text": "There."
    },
    {
      "start": 701.166,
      "end": 702.268,
      "text": "You're free."
    },
    {
      "start": 703.969,
      "end": 705.271,
      "text": "We've gotta check the wounded, ma'am."
    },
    {
      "start": 705.271,
      "end": 706.739,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 719.118,
      "end": 720.453,
      "text": "It's okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 731.63,
      "end": 732.765,
      "text": "I'm Sarah."
    },
    {
      "start": 734.532,
      "end": 737.403,
      "text": "I need to ask you for a favor."
    },
    {
      "start": 737.403,
      "end": 740.172,
      "text": "I give you food,"
    },
    {
      "start": 740.172,
      "end": 743.075,
      "text": "you do me a favor."
    },
    {
      "start": 744.61,
      "end": 747.279,
      "text": "Okay?"
    },
    {
      "start": 749.281,
      "end": 751.751,
      "text": "[man groaning in pain]"
    },
    {
      "start": 772.137,
      "end": 774.507,
      "text": "It's okay, it's okay. It's fine."
    },
    {
      "start": 776.241,
      "end": 780.379,
      "text": "I need to see what it did to you."
    },
    {
      "start": 781.48,
      "end": 783.783,
      "text": "It's okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 810.141,
      "end": 812.178,
      "text": "This world had changed all of us..."
    },
    {
      "start": 813.978,
      "end": 815.548,
      "text": "but Amir had been reborn..."
    },
    {
      "start": 817.682,
      "end": 819.552,
      "text": "with something entirely new."
    },
    {
      "start": 854.853,
      "end": 857.423,
      "text": "[shouting and gunfire]"
    },
    {
      "start": 858.99,
      "end": 861.26,
      "text": "You see all these men?"
    },
    {
      "start": 862.894,
      "end": 864.53,
      "text": "They're going out to fight."
    },
    {
      "start": 865.797,
      "end": 869.067,
      "text": "To try to make it how it was before."
    },
    {
      "start": 869.067,
      "end": 873.072,
      "text": "To stop those beasts from doing more of this..."
    },
    {
      "start": 874.74,
      "end": 877.209,
      "text": "[crying out in pain]"
    },
    {
      "start": 878.71,
      "end": 879.645,
      "text": "What is it with her"
    },
    {
      "start": 879.645,
      "end": 880.913,
      "text": "and that fucking thing?"
    },
    {
      "start": 883.415,
      "end": 885.351,
      "text": "Her daughter is gone."
    },
    {
      "start": 887.185,
      "end": 888.921,
      "text": "[Carl]: Everyone's daughter is gone."
    },
    {
      "start": 891.222,
      "end": 893.892,
      "text": "[Jasper]: The ones that are experimented on,"
    },
    {
      "start": 893.892,
      "end": 896.695,
      "text": "who survive..."
    },
    {
      "start": 896.695,
      "end": 898.964,
      "text": "the very few..."
    },
    {
      "start": 898.964,
      "end": 900.232,
      "text": "Her theory is"
    },
    {
      "start": 900.232,
      "end": 904.002,
      "text": "it's because they have some kind of predisposition."
    },
    {
      "start": 904.002,
      "end": 906.405,
      "text": "They're savants of some kind."
    },
    {
      "start": 907.439,
      "end": 909.341,
      "text": "And Amir is like that."
    },
    {
      "start": 910.709,
      "end": 912.21,
      "text": "[Sarah]: These men are trying to stop the genocide."
    },
    {
      "start": 912.21,
      "end": 916.181,
      "text": "[Ryan]: Alpha team! Move out!"
    },
    {
      "start": 920.385,
      "end": 922.922,
      "text": "[Sarah]: They're ready to sacrifice themselves."
    },
    {
      "start": 924.189,
      "end": 925.124,
      "text": "Let's go!"
    },
    {
      "start": 927.793,
      "end": 929.561,
      "text": "They don't have to die tonight."
    },
    {
      "start": 931.163,
      "end": 932.164,
      "text": "Help us."
    },
    {
      "start": 932.164,
      "end": 933.765,
      "text": "Please."
    },
    {
      "start": 933.765,
      "end": 935.367,
      "text": "Tell me what futures you see."
    },
    {
      "start": 938.536,
      "end": 939.604,
      "text": "Turn to the left."
    },
    {
      "start": 939.604,
      "end": 941.674,
      "text": "Incoming!"
    },
    {
      "start": 956.855,
      "end": 960.359,
      "text": "You can help us turn the tide, Amir."
    },
    {
      "start": 960.359,
      "end": 962.393,
      "text": "We can beat them."
    },
    {
      "start": 962.393,
      "end": 963.595,
      "text": "[gunfire]"
    },
    {
      "start": 969.2,
      "end": 970.402,
      "text": "Threat down in Fox Squadron."
    },
    {
      "start": 970.402,
      "end": 971.27,
      "text": "Threat down."
    },
    {
      "start": 974.205,
      "end": 976.475,
      "text": "All right, everyone, triple-check those brain locks."
    },
    {
      "start": 978.744,
      "end": 980.145,
      "text": "I don't want anyone looking at it,"
    },
    {
      "start": 980.145,
      "end": 982.581,
      "text": "and keep out of its line of sight, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 996.094,
      "end": 997.629,
      "text": "[Sarah]: What do you see?"
    },
    {
      "start": 999.831,
      "end": 1001.667,
      "text": "Do you see us winning, Amir?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1003.735,
      "end": 1005.704,
      "text": "Go! Go! Go!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1010.342,
      "end": 1012.211,
      "text": "[Sarah]: Can we learn to hunt them?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1014.646,
      "end": 1016.749,
      "text": "Can we make them fear us?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1018.583,
      "end": 1020.052,
      "text": "Go! Go!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1024.956,
      "end": 1027.126,
      "text": "Amir..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1029.094,
      "end": 1031.196,
      "text": "Do you remember what they did to you?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1032.397,
      "end": 1035.034,
      "text": "They do experiments all day and all night."
    },
    {
      "start": 1038.069,
      "end": 1039.738,
      "text": "They tear people apart."
    },
    {
      "start": 1041.806,
      "end": 1042.908,
      "text": "[gunfire]"
    },
    {
      "start": 1042.908,
      "end": 1044.008,
      "text": "It's wounded!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1044.008,
      "end": 1045.843,
      "text": "That fucking thing! Don't let it get away!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1045.843,
      "end": 1047.746,
      "text": "[gunfire]"
    },
    {
      "start": 1049.747,
      "end": 1051.784,
      "text": "[Sarah]: Billions die..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1054.486,
      "end": 1055.621,
      "text": "No one lives."
    },
    {
      "start": 1055.621,
      "end": 1057.389,
      "text": "Not through that."
    },
    {
      "start": 1065.43,
      "end": 1067.599,
      "text": "But every once in a while, a miracle happens."
    },
    {
      "start": 1069.867,
      "end": 1072.471,
      "text": "One in ten million, like you."
    },
    {
      "start": 1074.406,
      "end": 1077.609,
      "text": "Someone who somehow survives..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1079.544,
      "end": 1081.113,
      "text": "Their cruelty."
    },
    {
      "start": 1086.184,
      "end": 1088.486,
      "text": "Those things have given you an amazing power."
    },
    {
      "start": 1088.486,
      "end": 1089.655,
      "text": "A gift."
    },
    {
      "start": 1091.623,
      "end": 1092.657,
      "text": "Beyond man."
    },
    {
      "start": 1092.657,
      "end": 1093.859,
      "text": "Don't look at it!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1093.859,
      "end": 1094.926,
      "text": "Look away!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1094.926,
      "end": 1097.629,
      "text": "You can do the things they do."
    },
    {
      "start": 1112.377,
      "end": 1114.446,
      "text": "Put it down, Martinez! Put it down!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1120.352,
      "end": 1121.719,
      "text": "Don't do it, Martinez!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1121.719,
      "end": 1122.887,
      "text": "Don't do it!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1122.887,
      "end": 1125.157,
      "text": "[gunshot]"
    },
    {
      "start": 1149.714,
      "end": 1151.85,
      "text": "Amir..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1151.85,
      "end": 1153.252,
      "text": "Please tell me..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1155.386,
      "end": 1157.823,
      "text": "What futures do you see?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1161.96,
      "end": 1163.695,
      "text": "[crying out]"
    },
    {
      "start": 1172.403,
      "end": 1175.407,
      "text": "Cut its fucking head off."
    },
    {
      "start": 1189.588,
      "end": 1191.189,
      "text": "Amir, it's tine."
    },
    {
      "start": 1191.189,
      "end": 1192.824,
      "text": "You have to use what they gave you."
    },
    {
      "start": 1198.13,
      "end": 1199.831,
      "text": "It's not a choice."
    }
  ],
